                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "65647e50-6f9a-4cbb-85b6-f0eb4a60f483",
                                                "sense_id": "f55a0254-4576-36d8-adf2-0ab2a674176f",
                                                "text": "Mr. WADE. I move to take up House bill No. 15 to provide a temporary government for the Territory of Montana."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13e6ec73-70dd-43f9-af1e-241452fcdbbc",
                                                "sense_id": "f55a0254-4576-36d8-adf2-0ab2a674176f",
                                                "text": "While I've gazed at the sky from my sleeping bag on isolated mountaintops in Montana and southern beaches of Mexico and seen a jazillion stars basking in the peace of the evening, only in Rishikesh do the jazillion merge upon another bajillion jazillion and seem to lay overhead thick as glittering ceiling tiles."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b1ee2401-4c46-430a-a425-68b2cb41feff",
                                                "sense_id": "f55a0254-4576-36d8-adf2-0ab2a674176f",
                                                "text": "First, the president’s uncle died in 1985. Kaczynski was publicly revealed as the Unabomber more than a decade later, in 1996, when he was captured; before that, he had lived as a recluse in the Montana wilderness."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
